<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Esther</book>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt">Esther</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahasueras damlai a sil tung tambang ahi. Tam Ahasueras khu India apat Ethiopia dong, gamkai za leh sawmni leh sagi tunga leeng vaihawm a na pang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hunlai a leengpa Ahasueras Shushan khopi a aleengtoupha tunga atou lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />avaihawmna kum thum achin kum in akhawnbawl upate leh amiliente zousie adingin annkuongluina abawl hi. Persia leh Media gam galkap lamkaite, gam sung miliente leh gamkai a uhpipate atel kim chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A leenggam hausatna thupidan, aletna thupina leh azatat huoina zousie ni tampi, ni za leh ni sawmgiet sung vingveng a en sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam nite ahing beitahin leengpa’n aleeng innpi shushan sunga, um mi zousie aneu pen apat alien pen donga dingin ni sagi sung leengpa innpi huon sungah annkuong alui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua huon sungah, puonkhai kaangte dumte puonmalngat leh vaukhau sandang in dangka sia kuolte a ki khituo in suong kaang khuom ah kihung hi. Sana leh dangka a kibawl touphate khu, suongkang, sandang leh adum a kizem, suongpeh tuong kipha tungah akitung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sana chi tuom tuom a kizem noute in dawn ding zu ahawm ua, leengpa silphalna dungzui in zu chia akiching mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zu khu noubem lienpi a hawm ahia, koima kipaubawl aum sih a, koipou in ama ut dan dan a adawn uh phal ahi, azieh pen michin in adei bangbang ua bawlsah dingin leengpa’n a innpi huong sunga zu lam sai miliente thu apiehsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengnu Vasti in zong leengpa Ahasueras leeng inn huong sungah numeite adingin annkuong luina khat abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani sagi ni a, leengpa Ahasueras lungtang zuin akipahsah laitah in, anasem michilge sagite, Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha leh Abagtha, Zethar leh Karkas te thu apie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lengnu Vasti aleeng lukhu khuin, leengpa mai ah hing zawpi unlen, mipite leh miliente mai ah amel hoina ala ding ahi, achi hi, aziehpen amanu a melhoi mama zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh leengnu Vasti in, tua michilgete thugen leengpa thupieh niel in ahing pei nuom sih hi. Tam thu ah leengpa alungthah mama a asungah athangpaina akuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpan dan thei mite leh hun umdan theisiem mipilte akikuppi a (aziehpen hichibanga dan leh tawn dan thei siem mite kikuppi khu leengpa bawldan ngaina ahi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lengpa zom a miliente pen Karshena, Shethar, Admatha, Tarshish, Meres, Marsena leh Memukan ahi ua, amaute Parsia leh Media milien sagi, leengpa kunga haw thei ngitnget te leh tua leenggam a dinmun sanga tou masa pente ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lengpa Ahasueras in michilgete agensah athupieh amanlou ziehin dan dungzuiin leengnu Vasti bang law ding ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Memukan in, leengpa leh amiliente mai ah, “Lengpa tung guoh ah leengnu Vasti akhiel sih a, leengpa Ahasueras gam sung pumpi a miliente zousie leh mipite zousie tunga dihloutah a sil bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen numei zousiein leengnu Vasti thuman louna athei ding ua, Lengpa Ahasueras in leengnu Vasti amai a hing pui dingin thu apie a, hinanleh ahing pei ut sih hi, chi athei ding ua, apasalte uh asimmaw ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni mama akipat in Persia leh Media milien numeiten leengnu gamtat dan aza ding ua, tuachi’n leengpa miliente kungah tuabangin agen ding ua, tuachi’n nahpitah a kisimmawna leh lungthahna ahing umdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin leengpa’n pha asah leh leengpa’n thupieh khat suo henlen, Vasti khu leengpa Ahasueras mai ah hing kilang nawn sih heh, chi in henlamdang theilou dingin, Persia leh Media dante lah ah gellut hi henlen, tualeh leengpa’n Vasti sanga melhoizaw midang khat kungah tua leengnu hina dinmun pie hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua leengpa thupieh bawl khu aleenggam sung pumpi a akihawmjah tah chiengin (a leenggam alien mama thuoi a) numeite zousie in apasalte uh alien leh aneu kungah zatatna ape ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tambang thuhilna in leengpa leh amiliente akipahsahta a, tuachi’n leengpa’n Memukan thu gen bangin abawlta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />aman a leenggam sung pumpi leh gamkai zousie ah amauh laizem leh amauh ham chietin agiel a, namchin kungah, pasal pouma ama innsung chiet ah thuneipen ahi ding ahi, chiin thuphuon ahah suohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte nua a leengpa Ahasueras lungthahna ahing dambep in, aman Vasti in bang ahiei abawl a, atunga bang thupieh kikesah atai chi ahing ngaituodoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa nasem asuohten leengpa kungah, “Leengpa adingin nungah siengthou dawnglai melhoi khat kisui hen, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n nungah siengthou melhoi zousie susa leeng innpi a numeite umna inn ah, numeite kempa, leengpa michilge Hegai etkolna inn a hing puikhawm dingin aleenggam sung leh gamkai pumpi ah miliente guot henlen, akizepna ding uleh akinu ding uh van leh sathaute kipie hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh nungah leengpa lungkimna pen khu Vasti taangin leengnu hita hen,” achi uhi. Tam thu in leengpa akipahsah a, aman tuabangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualaitah in susa leeng innpi huong sungah Juda mi khat aum a, amin Mordekai ahia, Jair tapa ahi. Jair khu Shimei tapa ahia, Shimei khu Kish tapa ahia, Benjamin mite khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kish khu Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in Judate leengpa Jakoniah toh Jerusalem apata sal a apui khawmte lah a khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mordekai in apaneu tanu asanggam numei khat Hadassah tua khu Esther ahi, ana kem piching a, amanu’n nu leh pa a nei nawn sih a, tam nungah khu amelhoi in aduong ching mama hi, tualeh anu leh apa ashitaah ziehin Mordekai in ama tanu dinga a lah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa thupieh leh athuphuonte akizah tahin, nungah tampi Shushan a leeng innpi a Hegai mikepna inn a ahing kikhopkhawm tah un, Esther zong leengpa leeng inn huongsungah ahing zawpi ua, Hegai in akikemsah hi. Hegai pen numeite umna enkolpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Esther in Hegai alungkim sah a, adeisahna anga hi. Tuachi’n aman melhoina dinga, kinu leh kizutna ding leh ann neh ding hoitah leh leengpa innpi sung a kipat in nungah teltuom sagi kintah in ape pai a, tualeh aman amanu leh anungahte umna dingin numeite umna innsunga mun hoipen aguot piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mordekai in genlou ding chia akham ziehin, Esther in, achi anam leh abe aphung koima kung ah agen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mordekai in Esther bangchin aum ei, tualeh atungah bang thu aum ei, chi thei nuom in numeite umna innmai leituol ah nichin in avah kawi kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nungah chinteng leengpa Ahasueras mai a akilah hun uh ahing tuntahin, numeite dinga dan kibawlpieh ha sawm leh hani a um nua un, tuabanga akisiensahna nite uh suhbukim ahi zel hi, ha guh sung mura thau akizut ding, haguh sung gimnamtuite a kizut ding, tualeh numeite melhoina ding a kizutna dang dangte kinu ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nungahte leengpa mai a ava kilah hun chieng un, numeite umna inn-a kipat a leengpa innpi a alut chieng a aken ding adei dei pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitahlam in amanu ava haw a, azingni zingmawng in numeite umna inn nina ah, leengpa michilge Shaashga, leengpa meite kempa kunga ahing kinuale kia ding ahi. Lengpa’n amanu tunga alungkim a amin a nua hat kia ahilou ngal leh leengpa kungah ahawkia thei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Atanu dinga amanu lapa Mordekai paneu Abihail tanu leengpa kunga ahaw hun ahing tun tahin, amanu’n numeite kempa leengpa michilge Hegai in athumopna chiloungal bangma angen sih hi. Esther in ama ente zousie deisahna atangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lengpa Ahasueras vaihawm kum sagina, aha sawmna, Tebeth ha in Esther leengpa innpi ah puilut in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lengpan numei dangte zousie sangin Esther a it penta a, nungah siengthou dangte sangin leengpa deisahna leh hepina atangta hi, tuazieh in leengpa’n Esther lutungah a leenglukhu akhusah a, Vasti mun ah leengnu in apangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpan amiliente leh avaihawmpite adingin annkuong Esther annkuong kichi thupitah in alui a, agam sung pumpi ah khawlni aphuonga, akiphalna dungzui in kipahman ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nungah siengthoute aniveina dinga ahing kikhop khawm lai un, Mordekai khu leengpa innpi kotkha ah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Mordekai in ahil bangin Esther in amanu hing kipatna innkuon leh aminam hina agenkhe nai sih hi, aziehpen Esther in Mordekai thuhilnate ama innsung a, akhawi piching lai mabangin a zui nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khummi hunlai a, Mordekai leengpa innkotpi a atou lai in, leengpa michilge nite Bigthan leh Teresh, kotpi venga umtegel alungthah ua leengpa Ahasueras tha tum in thu aguh phiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam thu kiphielgu khu Mordekai in atheikhata a, aman tam thuguh leengnu Esther kungah ahil a, tualeh Esther in Mordekai min in leengpa kungah ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam thu ahing kikanchien tahin, adih ahi chi akimuta a, tuachi’n tua mi nite kikhailupna tau tungah akikhailumta uhi. Tam thute leengpa muna ngel ah, leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam silte zouin, leengpa Ahasueras in Agag mi Hammedatha tapa Haman akaisang sah a, atawisanga akunga um milien dangte zousie sanga sangzaw touna ah atou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa kotpi bula um, leengpa suohte zousie in kun in Haman zatatna abawl uhi, aziehpen leengpan Haman khu, tuabanga bawl ding ahi chi in thupieh abawl hi. Hinanleh Mordekai akun sih a, zana zong ape sih hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa kotpi bul a um leengpa suohten Mordekai kungah, “Bangdinga leengpa thupieh zuilou na hiei?” achi uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuabang in nichin in agen ua, hinanleh aman angaikhiet tuonlou tah in, Mordekai gamtatdan Haman in athuoh theina diei mah, chi in, Haman ahilta uhi, aziehpen aman Juda mi ahi amauh ana hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mordekai in kun in ama zana ape nuom sih chi Haman in amu tahin alungthah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh aman Mordekai tung maimai a, khut hah ding ahawmthaw a, Mordekai mite koite ahiei chi ana hilta ua, tuaziehin Haman in leengpa Ahasueras leenggam a teng Mordekai chipi Judate zousie thagam siengna ding lampi asuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lengpa Ahasueras leenga apan kum sawm leh nina, aha khatna Nisan ha in, alungtup bawldoh na ding ani leh aha atel theina ding in Haman mai ah Pur kichi ai sanna abawl ua, tua ai san pen aha sawm leh nina Adar ha ni sawm leh thum ni a, tua ai san akieh tandongin ai asan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haman in leengpa Ahasueras kungah “Na leenggam a, gamkai zousie a kithethang leh kikhentuom minam khat a um a, amaute ngaina dan leh tawndante uh midangte ngaina dan leh tawndan toh akibang sih a, tualeh leengpa thupiehte zong azui sih uhi, tuaziehin amaute tambanga um sah pen leengpa adingin thuohzou huoilou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami leengpa’n na deidan ahileh, amaute suhchimitna ding, thukiehna khat kisuodoh henlen, tam nna semkhete a dingin keiman dangka sum talent tul sawm leengpa sumkoina ah ka pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n asuoi namna khutsip akhut apat alakhie a, Hamedatha tapa Agag mi Haman, Judate melmapa apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Haman kungah, “Dangka sum leh tua mite na dei bang banga na bawl dingin na kunga pieh ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ha khatna ni sawm leh thum ni in leengpa’n laigiel mite akihankhawm a, Haman thupieh dungzuiin leengpa miliente leh gamkai chin a uhpipate, tualeh gamkai tenga mipite tunga vaihawmte kungah amaute laiteng leh amauh ham chiet a kigiel in, leengpa Ahasueras min a kigiel in, tualeh leengpa khutsip in akinam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa leenggam sunga, gamkai zousie ah lai taite akisawl a, leengpa leenggam sunga gamkai zousie a Judate zousie, ateh akhang leh numei naupang zousie ha sawm leh nina Adar ha, ni sawm leh ni thum ni a nikhat thu a thagam a suhchimit ding, tualeh anei alamte zousie uh, galvan lah a lah pieh ding, chi in laihah ahawmzahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua thupieh lai kigiel teikhiet khat chiet, gamkai zousie ah akihawmzah a, laihah sunga thupieh kigiel banga, ani chiem ni a, mansa a aum theina ding un, nam chinteng kunga phuonzah ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laihah khu leengpa thupieh in laitaiten akin akin in ataipi ua, tua thuphuon khu Shushan innpi a phuonkhieh ahi. Lengpa leh Haman zu dawn in atoukhawm ua, hinanleh Shushan khopi amangbangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mordekai in tua thu kibawl zousie atheitah in apuonte abotkeh a, sai ip puon asil a, leivui akibuoh khum a, khopi sungah apei a, aw ngaitah leh hase tahin akapta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leengpa inn lutna kotpi tan ahing pei hi, aziehpen leengpa huong sungah sai ip puon sil in koima akilut sah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa thupieh leh thukhennna tunna gamkai zousie ah, Juda mite lah ah kana leh mauna nasatah a umta a, ann ngawlnate, kanate, danate leh mi tampite sai ip puon sil in leivui lah ah alum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther zen numeite leh mi chilgete ahing pei ua, tamthu amanu ahing hil tah un, leengnu Esther alungkham mama hi, Mordekai in a sai ip puonte sutkhie a asil ding puonte Esther in ahah a, hinanleh Mordekai in asang nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Esther in ama kem dinga kiguot leengpa michilge Hathak kichipa ahan a, bang zieha tam thute pieng ahiei chi theikhe dingin, Mordekai kunga va haw dingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hathak khu leengpa kotpi mai a khopi gawl zing aum Mordekai kungah ava hawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mordekai in atunga siltung zousie leh Judate suhchimitna dinga, Haman in leengpa sum koina a pieh dinga achiem sum za zong ana hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mordekai in amaute suhchimitna dinga Shushan khopi a kiphuong thupiehna lai teikhiet lai dalkhat Esther kunga ala ding leh ahilchet dingin amapa ana pie a, tualeh leengpa kunga valut a amite a dinga khotuona ngen a va guitam dinga, ngen tei tei dingin asawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hathak ahing kile kia a, Mordekai thugen zousie Esther kungah a hilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Esther in Hathak ahoupi a, akungah Mordekai a ding thuvaihah khat ahil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Lengpa suohte zousie leh leengpa gamkai a mite’n, koipou pasal hi in numei hitaleh hatloupi a leengpa inn huong sungnung a lut khu tha ahi ding a, tambang pel theina um sun khu leengpan asana lengchieng ama lam a alenate ahing ding chi dan khat um khu athei chiet uhi. Hinanleh kei pen ni sawmthum sung vingveng leengpa kunga lut ding a hat in ka umta sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Esther thugente Mordekai kunga ava hil tah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman tam dawnna thu anuahah kia hi; “Leengpa innpi sunga um nahi zieh a, Juda mite zousie lah a nang mai mai suohta dingin kingaituo sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tambang huna sip dide a na umleh, panpina leh hutkhietna mundanga kipat ahing pieng dinga, nang leh na pa innkuonte na mangthai ding uhi. Tambang hun a dinga leengnu dinmun hing tung nahi mel koi in athei ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengnu Esther in tambang dawnna Mordekai kungah ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pei inlen Susa khopi a Juda mite zousie khawm inlen, Kei a dingin ann ngawl unlen, nithum sung ann nelou tuidawnlouin sun lezan in um un, Kei leh ka nungahten zong tuabangin ann ka ngawl ding uhi. Tuazou chiengin dan toh kituoh sih nanleh, leengpa kungah ka vahaw dinga, ka manthai tah leh amangthai ka himai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mordekai akuondoh a, Esther thuhil zousie abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ani thum niin, Esther in leengnu puon asil a, leengpa inndan lien mai a, thukhenna inndan sungta pen ah ava dingta hi. Lengpa pen tua inndan lienpi sunga aleengtouna tungah, kotpi lam nga in atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpan leengnu Esther thukhenna inndan sung a, ding amu tahin, amanu ana kipahpi a, akhut a asana lengchieng Esther lam ah alehtou a, tuachi’n Esther in azuon a, aleengchieng mong ava thamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Leengnu Esther aw, bang e na dei? Bang ngen nuom na hiei? Ka leenggam kimkhat nangawn ka hing pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther in adawnga, “Leengpa’n pha nasah leh tuni in leengpa adinga ka annkuong lui Haman toh hing nehpi un aw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lengpa’n Esther genbanga ka bawl theina dingun “Haman akinthei pen in hing zawpi un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n leengpa leh Haman khu Esther annkuong luina ah ahawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zu adawn lai un, leengpa’n leengnu Esther adong kia a, “Bang ahiei na thumna? pieh na hi ding, tualeh bang ahiei na nget?” leenggam kimkhat nangawn phal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Esther in adawnga, “Ka silnget leh ka dei khu tami ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengpa deisahna katan a, leengpan ka ngetna ahing phal pieh ding leh zing chienga leengpa leh Haman a dinga ann kuong ka lui pieh ding ah hing pei unlen, tuachiengin leengpa dohna ka dawng ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua niin Haman kipahtah leh lungnuom tah in apei hi. Hinanleh leengpa kotpi bul a Mordekai ding lou leh amai a zauna mel zong pawlou a pielou kei a um amu in, Mordekai tungah alungthah mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahivang in Haman akideh ham hama a inn ah apeita hi. Tuachi’n alawmte leh azi Zeresh ahan sah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amaute kungah Haman in ahausatna thupi dante, atapa neitam dante leh leengpa’n ama lam tampi a apahtawinate leh milien leh vaihawmte tunga akaisang sah dante siel in aki-otsahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Haman in agenbe nalai a, “Lengnu Esther nangawn in zong a annkuong luina ah leengpa toh zawhkhawm dingin Kei chilou koimadang achiel sih hi, tualeh zing chieng a zong leengpa toh annkuong imkhawm dingin ahing chiel nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa kotpi bula tou Juda mi Mordekai ka mu laisie in, tamte zousiein lungkimna ahing pe sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n azi Zaresh leh alawmte zousie in akung ah, “Tong sawm nga a sang kikhailupna kem khat bawl hi henlen, tuami tunga Mordekai khailup dingin, zingmawngin leengpa kungah gen inlen, tua zou chieng in, leengpa toh annkuong im dingin kuon in” achi uhi. Tam thute’n Haman akipahsah a, kikhailupna kem abawlsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum zan in leengpa khu a imu theita sih a, ama’n leengte khangthu kigelna laibu hing tawi un chi’n thu apie a, tuachi’n tua thute leengpa mai ah asim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n kotkha venga pang leengpa michilge nite Bigthan leh Teresh in, leengpa Ahasueras tha atupna uh tungtang, Mordekai in ana genkhieh thu kigiel khu ahing mukheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n “Tami ziehin Mordekai tungah zana leh pahtawina kibawlkhalou amah?” achi hi. Akunga nasem leengpa suohten, ama dingin “Bangma akibawlkha sih hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lengpa’n “Innhuong sungah koi a um ei?” achi a, tualaitahin Haman khu kikhailupna ding bawla Mordekai khailup sah ding thu gen dingin leengpa huongsung pawnungzaw ah ahing lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa suohten akungah, “Haman inn huong sungah ading hi” achi uhi, tualeh leengpa’n “Hing lut heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haman aluta, leengpa’n akungah, “Leengpa’n apahtawi nuompa tungah bang chi kibawl ding ahiei?” achi hi. Haman in alungsim in, “Kei khel a leengpa’n apahtawi nuom ding koi a um diei mah?” chiin angaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haman in leengpa kungah, “Leengpa’n apahtawi nuom mi a dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />leengpa’n asil ngel leengpuontuol leh leengpa tuonna sakol leh alutunga akhuh zel leenglukhu kilasah henlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tam puontuol leh sakol khu leengpa milien zatathuoi pente lah a khat in, leengpa’n a pahtawi nuom mi khu silsah henlen, tua sakol tungah kituongsah henlen, khopi gawlzing teng zui in kizawpi henlen, amasangah, leengpa’n apahtawi nuom mi tungah tambanga kibawl ding ahi, chiin kiphuong malam zel heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Haman kungah, “Kintah in pei pai inlen, na gen bangin leengpuontuol leh sakol vala inlen, leengpa kotpi a tou Judami Mordekai tungah vabawl in, na gensate khat zong bawllou nei vawt sin,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haman in leengpuontuol leh sakol avala a, leengpa puontuol Mordekai asil sah a, sakol tung a tuongsah in khopi gawlzing tengah akai a, “Leengpa’n apahtawi nuom mi khu tambanga kibawl ahi,” chi in aphuong malam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuazou in Mordekai pen leengpa kotpi ah akinuale kia a, Hinanleh Haman khu nguitah leh alu kikhukhum in a inn ah kintah in apeita hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haman in azi Zeresh leh alawmte zousie kungah, atunga siltung zousie ahilta hi. Tuachi’n ama thuhil mipilte leh a zi Zeresh in akungah, “Amai a na pua kipatna Mordekai Judami pa ahile vang na zou vawt sih ding hi, hinanleh amasang ah na guollel ngeingei ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabanga akihoulim laitah un, leengpa michilgete ahing tung ua, Esther in abawl ankuongluina atel dingin, Haman kintahin azawpita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa leh Haman khu leengnu Esther annkuongluina imkhawm dingin akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani ni niin annkuongluina zu adawn lai un, leengpa’n leengnu Esther kungah, “Leengnu Esther bang ahiei na thumna? hing kipe ding ahi. Bang ahiei na nget? Ka leenggam kimkhat nangawn zong hing kipe ding ahi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengnu Esther in adawnga, “Aw leengpa na mitmu a deisahna katan a, leengpa lungkimna ahileh, ka hinna hing khawi pieh in, chi ka thumna ahi, tuaban ah ka mite hinna zong khawipieh in chi ka ngetna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Kei leh ka mite suhmangthai ding, thagam ding leh suhchimit dinga khohzou sieng ka hita uhi. Suohpa leh suohnu ding beeh ahiei a khohkhiet hi ulengvang, melmapan leengpa silsuhsiet dinzou ngailou ding hita nanleh hamlou a sip khinkhien ding hi ing a,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Ahasueras in leengnu Esther kungah, “Tuabanga bawl dinga lungtanga tumngam khu koi ahiei? tualeh tu’n ama hei ah a um ei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esther in, “Langpangpa leh melmapa tam tatsepa Haman ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Haman khu leengpa leh leengnu masang ah zau in achitun denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lengpa lungthah sengin annkuong luina pat in adingdoh a, leeng inn huongsunga huon lai ah apeita hi, hinanleh Haman in leengpa’n atunga abawl ding dan thukhenna abawlta chi athei zieh in leengnu Esther mai ah ahinna humbit dinga ngen dingin a umdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengpa leeng inn huonsunga kipat in annkuongluina inndan sungah ahing peikia tahin, Haman khu leengnu Esther lupna tungah ana pua a, tuachi’n leengpa’n “Ka innsung na ngawn a, ka mitmu a leengnu nasan suol tum nalai ahiei mah?” achi hi. Lengpa kam a thu apawt tahin, Haman mai atuom piehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengpa kem michilgete lah a khat Harbona in, “En in, leengpa hutkhietna dinga thugenpa Mordekai a kikhailupna dinga Haman in tong sawm nga a sang kem adaw a inn ah a um nalai hi, achi hi. Tuachi’n leengpa’n tuanah ama khailia un” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n “Mordekai khailupna dinga abawl kem ah Haman akhailumta uhi.” Tuachi’n leengpa lungthahna, aphata hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua niin leengpa Ahasueras in Judate melmapa Haman inn kuonte leengnu Esther kungah apeta hi. Tualeh Esther in Mordekai toh akinai dan uh agenkhiettah ziehin Mordekai leengpa mai ah ahing peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n asuoi namna khutsip, Haman kunga kipata alah khiet pen asutkhie a Mordekai khut ah apeta hi. Tualeh Esther in Mordekai khu Haman innsunga vaihawm in apangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Esther khu leengpa kengbul ah khupbohin ahitui toh thu agenkia a, Judate sietna ding bawlpa Agagmi Haman silgilou bawltupte heimang dingin angen ngut ngut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n asana leengchieng Esther lam ah avihtou a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuachi’n Esther ahing thoudoh a, leengpa maiah adingta hi. “Tualeh amanu’n tami’n leengpa alungkim sah a, adeisahna tangtah ka hileh, tualeh leengpa masanga tam khu sildih ahi a, amitmu a lungkimhuoi ahileh, leengpa leenggam sung zousie a um Juda mite suhmangna dinga Agagmi Hammedatha tapa Haman in laihah ahawmte phietmang dingin thupieh khat giel henlen, hawm heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ka mite tunga vangsietna tung ding Ken bangchi’n ka thuohzou mama diei? Tualeh ka chipite suhmangna bangchi a Ken en ngam mama ding ka hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Ahasueras in leengnu Esther leh Juda mi Mordekai kungah, “En un Haman inn khu Esther kungah ka peta a, tualeh Judate tunga khut ahah ziehin ama zong khailupna kem dawn ah akhailumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin na dei bangbang un leengpa min in Juda mite a dingin lai giel unlen, leengpa suoi namna khutsip in nam un; aziehpen leengpa min a thupieh lai a kigiel a leengpa suoinamna khutsipa kinam khu koiman phel theilou ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hun laiin leengpa laigiel mite khu ha thumna Sivan ha ni sawmni leh nithum ni in ahankhawm pai ua, India akipat Ethiopia donga gamkai za leh sawmni leh sagi a um Judate kungah leh uhpi neute leh uhpipate leh miliente kungah Mordekai thupieh dungzui in laihah ding agiel uhi. Gamkai chin ah amauh laiteng chietin tualeh namchin amauh ham chiet in akigiel a, tualeh Judate kungah zong Juda lai leh ham in akigielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mordekai in leengpa Ahasueras min in lai agiel a, leengpa suoinamna khutsip in anam a, laitaite pen leengpa dinga kikhawituom sakol hat mamate a tuongin, tua laite ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua leengpa thupieh in khopi chintenga Judamite kikhopkhawm theina ding leh amaute kihumbit theina ding phalna apie a, tualeh tua thupieh in, koi chi koi nam leh koi gam hitaleh ama uleh anumei naupangte uh doudinga galvan tawi pouma, suhmang theina, tha theina leh agalte uh neisa lahpieh theina thuneina apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa Ahasueras gamsung pumpia, Judaten tambanga abawl theina ding ua ni kiguot khu, ha sawm leh nina, Adar ha, ni sawm le thum ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam thupieh teikhiet dalkhat chiet, gamkai pumpi a, khumi ni chienga Judaten amelmate uh tunga phuba la thei dinga mansa a aum theina ding ua, danthupieh a gellut dinga nam zousie kunga phuonzah ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa thupieh kinaw mama ziehin, laitaite khu leengpa sakol taihat pente a tuongin atai khie uhi. Tualeh tua thupieh khu Shushan khopi a leengpa innpi sungah zong akiphuong khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mordekai khu leengpuon dum leh ngou silin sana leenglukhu thupitah khu in, puonmalngat sandup puontuol sil in leengpa kunga kipat in apawtkhie a, Shushan khopi mite zousie lungdam in akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judate a dingin navahna, kipahna leh lungnopna leh zabawlna ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lengpa thupieh leh thukhenna tunna gamkai teng leh khopi zousie a, Juda mite lah ah lungdamna leh kipahna tualeh khawlni leh pawi thupitah a umta hi. Tuaban ah gamsung a namdang tampiten Judate a giin zieh un Judami asuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin ha sawm leh nina, Adar ha, ni sawm leh thum niin, leengpa thukhenna leh thupiehte suhtangtun ahi ding laitah in leh Judate melmaten amaute zaw a thuneikhum akinem uhi. Hinanleh Judaten amelmate uh tunga thunei dingin ni khat thu in sil ahing kilumletta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lengpa Ahasueras gamkai sung pumpi a Judate amauh tenna khopi chiet ah akikhawm ua, amaute suhmang sawmte dou dingin akisata uhi. Namdangte zousie in amauh agiin tah zieh un, amaute koiman anang zouta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamkai pumpi sunga miliente, uhpi neute leh uhpi liente tualeh leengpa vaihawmten Mordekai agiintah zieh un, Judate apanpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Mordekai khu leengpa innpi sungah athunei mamata a, gamkai zousie ah aminthang suohta a, ahing thunei semsemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten amelmate uh asatlum sieng ua, athatgam ua, amauh mudate tungah a ut dan dan un abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shushan khopi a leeng inn huongsungah mi za nga athat ua, asumang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Parmashta, Arisai, Aridai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tualeh Judate melmapa Hammedatha tapa Haman tapate sawm zong amaun athat uhi, hinanleh gallah sum bangma ala sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni a Shushan khopi a leeng inn huongsunga kithatte aphaza leengpa kungah ahil pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengpa’n leengnu Esther kungah, “Judaten Susa khopi ah mi zanga leh Haman tapate sawm zong athatta ua, leengpa gamkai dangte ah bangachi bawlta uoi? Tuin bang ahiei na nget? Pieh na hi ding, ahisihleh na dei bang ahiei? ahing kibawlpieh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Esther in akungah, “Leengpa’n pha asahleh, Susa a um Judaten tunia thupieh bangbang zingchienga zong abawl uh phal hi henlen, Haman tapa sawmte khailupna dawn ah khai hi uheh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n tuabanga bawl dingin thupieh abawlta a, tualeh Shushan khopi ah thukhenna khat asuo a, Haman tapa sawmte akikhailum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adar ha ni sawm leh li niin zong Shushan khopi a um Judate akikhawm kia ua, tualeh Shushan ah mi za thum athat uhi, hinanleh gallah sumte bangma akhoi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin leengpa gamkai sunga um Judami umsunten zong ahinna uh humbit dingin akikhawm uhi, tualeh amelmate ua kipat in suotatna amu ua, tualeh amauh mudate lah a mi tulsawm sagi leh tulnga athat ua, hinanleh agallah sum bangma akhoi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam pen Adar ha ni sawm leh thum ni a siltung ahi a, ani sawm leh li ni in akhawldamta ua, pawi bawlna ni leh kipahna ni in azangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Shushan khopi a, um Judate pen ni sawm leh thum ni leh ni sawm leh li niin akikhawm ua, ni sawm leh nga ni in akhawldam ua, pawi bawlni leh kipah ni in azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin khoneu a tengte leh kulpi neilou khopi neu a teng Judaten, Adar ha ni sawm leh li ni khu kipahna ni leh pawi bawlna ni tualeh khawl ni leh silpiehte kipieh tuona ni leh ann neh khawmna ni in azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mordekai in tam thute agielkhie a, leengpa Ahasueras gamkai zousie a, anai leh gamla a um Judami zousie kungah ahahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumchin a Adar ha ni sawm leh li ni leh ni sawm leh nga ni khu, nit ding, chi tua laihah ah atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nite khu Judate agalte ua kipat akhawldamna ni u’leh adanate uh lungnopna asuohna ha, tualeh akana ni uh lungdam pawi bawlna ni asuohna ha, ahitah zieh in, amaun tua nite khu lungdam pawi bawl ni leh kipahna ni, tualeh khat leh khat ann kithah tuona leh gentheite kunga silpiehte piehna ni a zah ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Judaten ana bawlpatsa bang u’leh Mordekai in akung ua agel banga tawndan a nei in bawl atumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen Judate melmapa Agagmi Hammedatha tapa Haman in Judate suhmangna ding in thu asimphiel a, Pur ana santa hi, tuakhu amauh thagamna ding leh suhmangna dinga ai san na ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Esther leengpa mai a ahing dintahin, Judate sietna dinga athugilou phiel ama lutunga atuhna ding leh ama leh atapate khailupna dawn a, khailupna dingin leengpa’n thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun tam nite khu Pur thumal akipat la in Purim achi uhi. Tuaziehin tam laihah thute leh tam sil tungtanga asil mute u’leh atung ua siltungte zieh in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judaten amaute leh ahahasuonte u’leh amauh zuiten ahun kiguot dungzui a tam ni nite pellou a, kum chin a nitna dinga tawndan a pomkip ding chiin thu a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam nite, akhang akhanga, innkuon chinteng leh gamkai chinteng leh khopi chinteng in atheizing ua, anit ua, tualeh tam Purim nite khu Judate lah a thei ngitngetna ahah asuonte lah ua pat a abeimanglouna dingin anamdetta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Purim toh kisai tam laihah nina namdet na dingin, Abihail tanu leengnu Esther leh Judami Mordekai in thuneina toh lai agiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Mordekai in leengpa Ahasueras gamkai za leh sawmni leh sagi sunga teng Judamite zousie kungah, deisahna leh hamuonna laihahte ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Judami Mordekai leh leengnu Esther in amaute dinga aguot bang uleh, ann ngawl hun leh da leh ka hun toh kisai a, amaute leh ahah asuonte ua dinga aguot bang ua, Purim nite namdetna ding in lai ahah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lengnu Esther thupieh in Purim bawl dan ding toh kisai dante asukip a, tualeh sil chiemtena laibu sungah akigielutta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Ahasueras in agamsung leh tuipi kuolkhum gamte ah sie lah ding aguonggalta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Athuneina leh ahatna a, asilbawlte zousie leh leengpa’n Mordekai atawisangna, thupina kigennate, Medes leh Persia leengte khangthu laibu sungah akigiel hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Mordekai khu leengpa Ahasueras zom a lienpe’n ahi a, aman amipite hoina ding asui a, akituohna ding uh agen ziehin a unau Judate lah a athunei a, achipite lah ah athupi mamata hi.
  </para>
</usx>
